  "description": "Vince (28) is a universally acknowledged talented artist, yet he is never satisfied with his own work. Obsessed with painting the ‘perfect’ picture to fill that void, Vince one day meets an enigmatic man named Michel (30), who asks him to complete a painting left behind by someone else. The moment he first sees the painting, Vince feels a strange emotion, but ultimately agrees to take it on. Unaware where this decision will lead him.\n\n(Source: Ridibooks, translated)",
